  "description": "Nestled in the prestigious Golf Valley of Nueva Andalucía, Villa Las Palmeras is an exceptional contemporary residence offering an unrivalled luxury experience just minutes from Puerto Banús, Marbella's finest beaches, and world-renowned golf courses. Recently renovated to the highest standards, the villa combines sophisticated architecture, elegant interiors, and outstanding leisure facilities to create a truly exclusive Mediterranean retreat.\n\nDesigned with both comfort and style in mind, the property features five spacious en-suite bedrooms, each thoughtfully appointed to provide privacy and relaxation for every guest. At the heart of the villa, a beautiful Andalusian courtyard fills the living spaces with natural light, while expansive open-plan interiors seamlessly connect to the landscaped gardens and outdoor terraces.\n\nThe outdoor areas have been created for effortless indoor-outdoor living. Guests can enjoy a spectacular private swimming pool, a large outdoor Jacuzzi, beautifully maintained gardens, multiple sun terraces, elegant lounge areas, and a fully equipped outdoor kitchen with barbecue—perfect for long summer lunches and unforgettable evenings under the Marbella sky.\n\nInside, Villa Las Palmeras offers an exceptional range of luxury amenities. Hidden behind a discreet secret door is a fully equipped private gym, complemented by a wellness area featuring a sauna and steam room. The villa also boasts a stylish TV lounge, a private home cinema, and a dedicated games room with a pool table, ensuring entertainment and relaxation for guests of all ages.\n\nPerfectly positioned in one of Marbella's most sought-after residential areas, the villa offers easy access to championship golf courses, exclusive beach clubs, fine dining, luxury shopping, and the vibrant marina of Puerto Banús, while maintaining the peace and privacy expected from a luxury holiday home.\n\nWhether you're planning a family holiday, a golf getaway, or an exclusive summer retreat with friends, Villa Las Palmeras offers an unforgettable stay where contemporary design, premium comfort, and the very best of the Costa del Sol come together.\n\nPlease note that we welcome families and couples only, no groups under the age of 30, and no hen or stag parties. Should you fall outside of this category but wish to book nonetheless, please send us an enquiry detailing a little more about yourself and the group you will be travelling with so we can review your request with the property owner.",
